        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 443, Beaded Half-Round Knobset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nClassically styled, the 443 Beaded Half-Round Knobset made by Omnia is a perfect example of traditional beauty and elegance. The beaded detailing along the outside of both the rose and the knob adds just the right a mount of detail for traditional homes. It is available in 7 finishes. The Beaded Knob with Matching Rose is available in dummy, passage, or privacy functions for 1-3/8\", 1-3/4\", or 2\" door thicknesses with 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" backsets.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Half Round Beaded Door Knob with Round Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Solid brass construction.</li>\r\n<li>Fits most standard door cut outs.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Omnia 443 Beaded Half-Round Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Knob Diameter: 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Projection: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\", 1-3/4\", or 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>28 degrees rotation to retract latch.</li>\r\n<li>Fits standard 2-1/8\" inch door bore.</li>\r\n<li>Concealed screw rose.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> No door latch. Stationary door knob on one side of the door. Package Includes: 1 knob, 1 rose, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> No door latch. Stationary door knob on both sides of the door. Package Includes: 2 knobs, 2 rosettes, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates from either side of door. Package Includes: 2 knobs, 2 roses, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, solid spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need privacy locking. Latch operates from either side. Push button on interior rose engages privacy; emergency release hole is on exterior rose. Turning inside knob will release privacy push button and retract the door latch. Package Includes: 2 knobs, 2 roses, privacy button, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, slit spindle, and mounting screws</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MHE-brass-pinapple.jpg?v=1704354543\" width=\"600\" height=\"137\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Omnia Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Beaded Knob with Matching Rose",
                "description": "Classically styled, the 443 Beaded Half-Round Knobset made by Omnia is a perfect example of traditional beauty and elegance. The beaded detailing along the outside of both the rose and the knob adds just the right a mount of detail for traditional homes. It is available in 7 finishes. The Beaded Knob with Matching Rose is available in dummy, passage, or privacy functions for 1-3/8 inch, 1-3/4 inch or 2 inch door thicknesses with 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets.",
                "keywords": "OMN-443/00, Omnia traditional door Knobs, Elegant door Knob latchsets, Omnia 443 door Knobs, brass circular door Knobs, simple door Knobs, Omnia solid brass door Knob latchsets, solid brass door Knobs, passage Knobs, privacy Knobs, dummy Knobs,  omnia traditions collection, Beaded Traditional Knobsets, Traditional Beaded Knobs, Beaded Half-Round Knobsets,"
